{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b84f976c797_017","source_id":"src_5b84f976c797","source_hash":"ebbae8b616ad54feff60f5b9736c8b7f2bf9be5486a41629487324d46e03de1c","text":"{\n\"TransactionType\" : \"TicketCreate\" ,\n\"Account\" : \"rf1BiGeXwwQoi8Z2ueFYTEXSwuJYfV2Jpn\" ,\n\"Fee\" : \"10\" ,\n\"Sequence\" : 381 ,\n\"TicketCount\" : 10\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 230","char_start":4766,"char_end":4910,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:45.287Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b84f976c797_018","source_id":"src_5b84f976c797","source_hash":"ebbae8b616ad54feff60f5b9736c8b7f2bf9be5486a41629487324d46e03de1c","text":"In addition to the common fields , TicketCreate transactions use the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 233","char_start":4960,"char_end":5046,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:45.287Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b84f976c797_019","source_id":"src_5b84f976c797","source_hash":"ebbae8b616ad54feff60f5b9736c8b7f2bf9be5486a41629487324d46e03de1c","text":"Field JSON Type Internal Type Description","location_hint":"paragraph 234","char_start":5050,"char_end":5091,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:45.287Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b84f976c797_020","source_id":"src_5b84f976c797","source_hash":"ebbae8b616ad54feff60f5b9736c8b7f2bf9be5486a41629487324d46e03de1c","text":"TicketCount Number UInt32 How many Tickets to create. This must be a positive number and cannot cause the account to own more than 250 Tickets after executing this transaction.","location_hint":"paragraph 235","char_start":5095,"char_end":5271,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:45.287Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b84f976c797_021","source_id":"src_5b84f976c797","source_hash":"ebbae8b616ad54feff60f5b9736c8b7f2bf9be5486a41629487324d46e03de1c","text":"If the transaction cannot create all of the requested Tickets (either due to the 250-Ticket limit or the owner reserve ), it fails and creates no Tickets. To look up how many Tickets an account currently owns, use the account_info method and check the account_data.TicketCount field.","location_hint":"paragraph 236","char_start":5275,"char_end":5558,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:45.287Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b84f976c797_022","source_id":"src_5b84f976c797","source_hash":"ebbae8b616ad54feff60f5b9736c8b7f2bf9be5486a41629487324d46e03de1c","text":"This transaction increases the sending account&#x27;s sequence number by 1 plus the number of tickets created ( TicketCount ). This is the only transaction that increases an account&#x27;s sequence number by more than 1.","location_hint":"paragraph 238","char_start":5567,"char_end":5787,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:45.287Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b84f976c797_023","source_id":"src_5b84f976c797","source_hash":"ebbae8b616ad54feff60f5b9736c8b7f2bf9be5486a41629487324d46e03de1c","text":"Besides errors that can occur for all transactions, TicketCreate transactions can result in the following transaction result codes :","location_hint":"paragraph 240","char_start":5802,"char_end":5934,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:45.287Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b84f976c797_024","source_id":"src_5b84f976c797","source_hash":"ebbae8b616ad54feff60f5b9736c8b7f2bf9be5486a41629487324d46e03de1c","text":"temINVALID_COUNT The TicketCount field is invalid. It must be an integer from 1 to 250.","location_hint":"paragraph 242","char_start":5964,"char_end":6051,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:45.287Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b84f976c797_025","source_id":"src_5b84f976c797","source_hash":"ebbae8b616ad54feff60f5b9736c8b7f2bf9be5486a41629487324d46e03de1c","text":"tecDIR_FULL This transaction would cause the account to own more than the limit of 250 Tickets at a time, or more than the maximum number of ledger objects in general.\nThe maximum ledger objects error is effectively impossible to receive if","location_hint":"paragraph 243","char_start":6053,"char_end":6293,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:45.287Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b84f976c797_026","source_id":"src_5b84f976c797","source_hash":"ebbae8b616ad54feff60f5b9736c8b7f2bf9be5486a41629487324d46e03de1c","text":"Requires the fixDirectoryLimit . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 244","char_start":6295,"char_end":6338,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:45.287Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b84f976c797_027","source_id":"src_5b84f976c797","source_hash":"ebbae8b616ad54feff60f5b9736c8b7f2bf9be5486a41629487324d46e03de1c","text":"tecINSUFFICIENT_RESERVE The sending account does not have enough XRP to meet the owner reserve of all the requested Tickets.","location_hint":"paragraph 246","char_start":6353,"char_end":6477,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:56:45.287Z"}
